## Deploy

`.github/workflows/release.yml` builds `ghcr.io/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_slug }}`
after CI passes on `main`, and once the bot is on a host it redeploys it there. To set
up a host (one small VM can run several bots) and add this bot to it, see
[Hosting](https://mohanz1.github.io/discord-bot-base/hosting/): in short,
`add-bot {{ project_slug }} ghcr.io/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_slug }} --key '<ci public key>'`
on the host, the `DEPLOY_HOST` / `DEPLOY_KEY` / `DEPLOY_KNOWN_HOSTS` secrets here, then
the repo variable `DEPLOY_ENABLED=true`.

